ates viz. Madurai Trans Carrier Limited, Lynks Logistics Limited and Consolidated results of The Ramco Cements Limited, Ramco Systems Limited, Rajapalayam Mills Limited, Ramco Industrial and Technology Services Limited.       7. The previous period figures have been re-grouped / restated wherever considered necessary.</in-bse-fin:DisclosureOfNotesOnFinancialResultsExplanatoryTextBlock>
